{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgmh6onPy1zFbThyXp82R","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Quick update: I've scrolled through 7 of the 8 screens and I'm stopping here. The page already pointed me to an answer.\n\n**What I'd tell a friend:** The page says the cheapest way for Tel Aviv 125 is a Pesagot (פסגות) account with the IBI tracker fund, \"אי.בי.אי. מחקה (4A) ת\"א 125\". It shows 86,045 ₪ after 10 years, and Pesagot's account costs about 1,049 ₪ over those years. I'm fairly sure, not totally. What decided it was the \"הבחירה שלכם · ★ הזול\" box and Pesagot sitting at number one in the accounts list. Pesagot isn't a bank I know, though, so it gave me a moment's pause. Next step is opening an account there and setting up a monthly buy.\n\n**How it went:**\n- **Screen 1:** The heading \"איפה ואיך הכי זול להשקיע במדד\" was exactly my question, and \"ת\"א-125\" was already picked. I left the sliders on 10,000 ₪, 500 ₪ a month and 10 years. They aren't my 30,000, but I didn't fiddle with them.\n- **Screen 2:**\n  - The first big number I saw was 86,045 ₪ for \"פסגות ניירות ערך\" plus the IBI fund. That's the one that stuck.\n  - Funds list: the IBI one is at \"-0.04%\" and the others show things like \"-1,030 ₪\".\n  - Accounts list: Pesagot 86,045, then לאומי 82,968.\n- **Screens 3–4:** I scrolled the accounts down. The big names (הבינלאומי, הפועלים, דיסקונט, מזרחי) all come out lower. The ones I've never heard of (אלטשולר טרייד, אקסלנס, מיטב טרייד) are around 63,000 with big red bars, so I wouldn't go near them.\n- **Screens 5–7:** I only looked at the headings and bars. One chart (\"מה הכי משנה…\") I skipped. One chart again ended at 86,045 with Pesagot + IBI on top. A table had Pesagot in green, \"עוד 5,022 ₪\".\n- **Didn't read:** the small text about how each account's fees are worked out, anything under the \"לא בחישוב\" tags, and screen 8.\n\n**Where I got stuck:**\n- The \"-0.04%\" in green next to my pick. A minus looks bad, but it's the one marked as the choice, so I wasn't sure what it meant.\n- Is \"קרן מחקה\" different from \"קרן סל\"? The page uses both labels.\n- The coloured bars. I guessed orange means buying and selling fees and yellow means \"דמי משמרת\".\n- The first screen says \"70,000 ₪\" next to \"86,045 ₪\". I think that's just what I put in, but I'm not 100% sure.\n- The flat 7% a year: I didn't touch it.\n- I got bored around the line chart and would have closed the page there.\n\n**Words I didn't get:** \"דמי משמרת\", \"צוברת\", \"מחזיקה את המניות\", \"כמה דרכים יחד\", \"נאמן\", \"4A\", \"(40)\", \"קבועים\", \"מסלול ONE\"."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1893,"cache_read_input_tokens":15539,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1893},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d877d8d2-1619-454a-8a20-bb598fc1a915","uuid":"56450168-09e1-431e-900a-400da96842f9","timestamp":"2026-11-06T12:42:05.639Z","request_id":"req_011Cgmh6oZkTGiWfAZm8BVYV"}
